# bnc.sym -- A coaxial jack: its one pin is the center conductor
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# A circle of 4.3 pt radius round a dot, the lead to the dot.  The
# shield is not a pin: it is held by whatever the jack mounts in.
prefix J
pin 1 -2 0 l
box -1.5 -0.8 0.8 0.8
side above
line -14.4 0 0 0
circle 0 0 4.3
disk 0 0 1.2
